# Attachments Directory

This folder is reserved for file attachments.

When using the File System Access API or Electron in the future, files will be stored here with their SHA-256 hash as the filename:

```
attachments/
├── 92bd11a3f7e8c4d5.pdf
├── a94f3c2b1e8d7f6a.png
└── ...
```

Currently, attachments are stored in IndexedDB as base64-encoded data.
